    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log": "Research Journal",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_1.1": "We reached the location to which He bade us journey, a laborious march spanning many days. As the sun surrendered to dusk, we rested our wearied bodies upon the earth for what I trust to be the final time. This morn,",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_1.2": "we rose with purpose anew, and began to etch a barrier of logs and home of stone.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_2.1": "Our construction draws nigh its completion. As I pen these very words, the final shipment of supplies flow into our haven - enough timber, freshly hewn from the surrounding wilds, to finish the enclosure, and panes of glass",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_2.2": "sent from Fort Greater. Soon shall the research commence, the likes of which may yet shake the pillars of the world.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_3.1": "A strange unease takes root within my mind. This magic - though wondrous - doth twist the senses. I could have sworn there was a cellar beneath the chapel's floor, and yet now none recall it. Even my most trusted lieutenant",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_3.2": "claims such a thing never was. Am I alone in this delusion? Has madness begun to gnaw at me?",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_4.1": "Our scouts return with tidings of a village, not far from our encampment. This is good news, for supplies dwindle. We shall lay siege and easily procure what is needed, for the distance is not great.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_4.2": "However, the magical research in these lands proves troublesome - few are the answers we seek. It may soon come to pass that we abandon this place, move to the next site.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.header": "Day ",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_1": "We arrived at the location He sent us to just before last dusk, a march of many days. One last time, we slept on the dirt; this morning we rose with purpose anew, beginning to etch a barrier of logs and home of stone.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_2": "Construction is near complete. As I write, supplies make their way into our hospice - freshly hewn wood from the area, a shipment of glass from fort greater. Discovery awaits.",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_3": "I had never thought it possible, this magic seems to be messing with my mind. I swear there used to be a cellar below the chapel, yet even my second in command says it were never so... Surely I cannot be the one going mad?",
    "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_4": "Scouts have returned with fantastic news, that of a village, and not too far to return the supplies here with ease after laying siege. However, magical research in this area seems to be inconclusive. We may be abandoning soon.",
